Package: libdynemit-dev
Version: {{VERSION}}
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MuriloChianfa <murilo.chianfa@outlook.com>
Depends: libdynemit (= {{VERSION}}), libc6-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/MuriloChianfa/libdynemit
Description: SIMD dynamic dispatch library - development files
 libdynemit provides automatic SIMD runtime dispatch using ifunc resolvers.
 Write portable code that automatically uses the best SIMD instructions
 (SSE2, SSE4.2, AVX, AVX2, AVX-512F) available on the target CPU.
 .
 Features:
  - Automatic CPU feature detection at program startup
  - Thread-safe SIMD level detection
  - Support for GCC 13+ and Clang 16+
  - All-in-one library or modular feature libraries
  - C23 and C++17+ compatible
 .
 This package contains static libraries, header files, and pkg-config
 support for developing applications that use libdynemit.
